{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13372","headline":"唐德明兴圣庙乐章 兴圣酌献 · 李纾","name":"唐德明兴圣庙乐章 兴圣酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"閟宫静谧，合乐周张。\n泰尊始献，百末重觞。\n震澹存诚，庶几迪尝。\n遥源之祚，天汉灵长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李纾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}